TI  - Evaluation of the Pathogenicity of &lt;i&gt;Beauveria bassiana&lt;/i&gt; Biopesticide against &lt;i&gt;Blattella germanica&lt;/i&gt; (Blattaria: Ectobiidae)
AU  - Nourozi, Behzad
AU  - Azari-Hamidian, Shahyad
AU  - Majidi-Shilsar, Farzad
