TI  - Biological characteristics and pathogenicity of entomopathogenic Beauveria bassiana (Bals.-Criv.) Vuill (Hypocreales: Cordycipitaceae) isolated from soils in Northern Kenya against desert locust (Schistocerca gregaria) (Forskål) (Orthoptera: Acrididae)
