TI  - Community effectiveness of pyriproxyfen as a dengue vector control method: A systematic review
AU  - Maoz, Dorit
AU  - Ward, Tara
AU  - Samuel, Moody
AU  - Müller, Pie
AU  - Runge-Ranzinger, Silvia
AU  - Toledo, Joao
AU  - Boyce, Ross
AU  - Velayudhan, Raman
AU  - Horstick, Olaf
