TI  - Monitoring persistence of the entomopathogenic fungus Metarhizium anisopliae under simulated field conditions with the aim of controlling adult Aedes aegypti (Diptera: Culicidae)
AU  - Carolino, Aline T
AU  - Paula, Adriano R
AU  - Silva, Carlos P
AU  - Butt, Tariq M
AU  - Samuels, Richard I
